nty"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids, September to October came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those years, and in 2025 it hit 68% while November to December fell to 51%. So far in 2026, February to March sat at 65% on the middle of the grids. Grids 16076 and 16376 had their driest year in 2007, at 45% of normal.</p>"}
